:{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/pulls/47721","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/47721","diff_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/47721.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/47721.patch","merged_at":"2023-03-31T03:26:39Z"},"body":"By default, `serde-json` will transform a `None` into a `null` value, and Next's [default image loader][loader] will perform strict `=== undefined` [equality checks][checks] on the fields. Because `null !== undefined`, a missing `protocol` or `port` will always be checked, and `null` will never match either.\r\n\r\nFixes #46758\r\nFixes vercel/turbo#4347\r\nFixes WEB-770\r\nfix NEXT-793\r\n\r\n[loader]: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/35cf930572f70fb7f64bbccce833584c14b9da0c/packages/next/src/shared/lib/image-loader.ts#L50\r\n[checks]: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/35cf930572f70fb7f64bbccce833584c14b9da0c/packages/next/src/shared/lib/match-remote-pattern.ts#L5\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/47721/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/47721/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":8893659311,"node_id":"CE_lADOBC3Cis5f8fJkzwAAAAISGniv","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/events/8893659311","actor":{"login":"kodiakhq[bot]","id":49736102,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk3MzYxMDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kodiakhq%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/kodiakhq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kodiakhq%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kodiakhq%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":